  "notes": "All endpoints use HTTP Basic auth on port 15672. /api/queues and /api/nodes return arrays, so each element yields a series labelled by name (and vhost for queues). message_stats may be absent on objects with no activity yet. The docs do not state whether uptime is a counter; it is treated as a gauge (milliseconds). 'running' is boolean rather than numeric and needs conversion. The string fields (rabbitmq_version, erlang_version, node, state) are not numeric metrics; they could serve as info-style labels."
